From f7ce8739db935e7cec2c150f5b02636d2786b653 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gabe Lapingcao <mgultra2018@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 16 Aug 2026 17:13:53 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 10/14] [tests/gtest]: refactor test execution around
 std::variant

Changes common data structures used within `TestCase` to use
`std::variant` aliases, `TedVar` and `RibVar`, as data member types.
Implements a custom ADL serializer for JSON parsing and serialization.

Signed-off-by: Gabe Lapingcao <mgultra2018@gmail.com>
